lhsr (1.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian package release.
  * Kernel module (dm-lhsr.ko) via DKMS.
  * Userspace daemon (lhsrd), CLI (lhsrctl), recovery tool (lhsr-scan).
  * systemd service for monitoring daemon.
  * initramfs-tools hook for boot-time array autodiscovery.

 -- LHSR Team <team@lhsr.dev>  Tue, 23 Jun 2026 22:00:00 +0000
